      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140514_19142038_0254.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140514_19142038_0254&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140514_19142038_0254.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140514_19143226_0255.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140514_19143226_0255&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/postcard-2014-20140514_19143226_0255.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From: G.H.L, To: Elijah H. Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Bosworth, MO on October 4, 1909&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mr. E.H. Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bosworth, MO Oct. 4&lt;br&gt;
landed here am working. Feeling fine. Send me half a dozen of the squirrels. 73 to all&lt;br&gt;
G.H.L.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
